00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:52.460
I don't want to get stuck here till night court.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:54.620
- Come. - I really don't want inconvenience you.

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:56.210
I'll come back tomorrow.

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:57.430
Come on.

