Oh, Mrs. Farragut.

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:24.840
Are those people still bothering you?

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:26.130
Oh, worse than ever, officer.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:27.990
Why haven't you given me predictions?

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:30.000
Oh, but I have 12 men guarding you.

