00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.290
Well, no, I've got to keep in touch with the president.

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:06.670
Oh, well, of course, of course.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.470
Well, goodbye. Thank you so very much.

